      <Text>MAIN() controls the highest level of operation and is the file that actually writes to the OUTPUTS()
MAIN() as a result, control AUTO and OFF modes.</Text>
      <RtfText>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Microsoft Sans Serif;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green128\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\f0\fs17 MAIN() controls the highest level of operation and is the file that actually writes to the OUTPUTS()\line MAIN() as a result, control AUTO and OFF modes.\par
}
</RtfText>
